  "description": "This package contains the BuildVersion struct which represents the version in format `yy.b.mdd` where:\n        - `yy` — last two digits of Year component;\n        - `b` — incrementing build number, resets to 1 every year;\n        - `m` — month component without leading zero (May = `5`, October = `11`);\n        - `dd` — day of month component with leading zero (5th = `05`)",
